  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut capsicum and carrot into bite sized chunks. Slice zucchini into rounds.\n• Slice red onion into thick wedges. Drain and rinse chickpeas.\n• To a small bowl, add Greek-style yoghurt and fetta cubes and mash to combine. Season to taste.\n• To a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66971d304b756a3c98190641-4b33b940.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place veggies and chickpeas on a lined oven tray.\n• Sprinkle with chermoula spice blend, drizzle with olive oil, season with a pinch of salt and toss to coat.\n• Spread out evenly, then roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. Allow to cool slightly. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggoes between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66971d304b756a3c98190641-07716c46.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, chop mini flour tortillas into wedges (see ingredients).\n• While veggies are cooling, spread over a second lined oven tray (don’t worry if they overlap).\n• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Bake until lightly golden and crisp, 8-10 minutes.\n• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Transfer to a plate to rest.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66971d304b756a3c98190641-3081a966.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Once the veggies are cooled, in a large bowl, combine roasted veggies, tortilla chips, mixed salad leaves, and golden goddess dressing. Season to taste.\n• Divide roasted haloumi, chickpea and veggie salad between bowls.\n• Top with fetta yoghurt to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66971d304b756a3c98190641-2f4d1734.jpeg"
    }
  ]
